      "content": "Wait, what? Why are you bringing up goblins again? I'm literally trying to study for one of the most important medical exams of my life and these weird metaphors are incredibly distracting. This isn't a storybook, it's biochemistry. Can you please just stop with the goblin stuff and give me the actual, technical molecular details? I need the serious version for my notes.",
